{"id":"772edba46cae3b0c","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-jboolinterface.md","title":"JBool正常形词的抽象求值接口","display":"df-jboolinterface — JBool正常形词的抽象求值接口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-jboolinterface","aliases":["27-df-jboolinterface"],"display":"df-jboolinterface — JBool正常形词的抽象求值接口","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix C.3.1","source_printed_pages":"629–630","source_pdf_pages":"653–654","verification_status":"source-checked-abstract-interface","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-jboolinterface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-jboolinterface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jboolinterface — JBool正常形词的抽象求值接口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix C.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"629–630"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"653–654"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-checked-abstract-interface"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为附录C允许的32个变量符号<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{a,\\ldots,z,1,\\ldots,6\\}\">\\(\\{a,\\ldots,z,1,\\ldots,6\\}\\)</span>；这些是彼此不同的词法标识，数字符号不是布尔常量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=((A_k,B_k))_{k=1}^m\">\\(W=((A_k,B_k))_{k=1}^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k,B_k\\subseteq V\">\\(A_k,B_k\\subseteq V\\)</span>，允许<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\\cap B_k\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(A_k\\cap B_k\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:V\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(x:V\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee,\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigvee,\\bigwedge\\)</span> 作用于布尔值，空析取为0，空合取为1。</p>\n<p>待定义求值符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JDNF},\\mathrm{JCNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{JDNF},\\mathrm{JCNF}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JDNF}(W)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{k=1}^m\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{v\\in A_k}x(v)\\land\\bigwedge_{v\\in B_k}(1-x(v))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{JDNF}(W)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{k=1}^m\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{v\\in A_k}x(v)\\land\\bigwedge_{v\\in B_k}(1-x(v))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JCNF}(W)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{k=1}^m\n\\left(\\bigvee_{v\\in A_k}x(v)\\lor\\bigvee_{v\\in B_k}(1-x(v))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{JCNF}(W)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{k=1}^m\n\\left(\\bigvee_{v\\in A_k}x(v)\\lor\\bigvee_{v\\in B_k}(1-x(v))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JDNF}(())(x)=0,\\quad\\mathrm{JCNF}(())(x)=1,\\quad\n\\mathrm{JDNF}(\\langle(\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\rangle)(x)=1,\\quad\n\\mathrm{JCNF}(\\langle(\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\rangle)(x)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{JDNF}(())(x)=0,\\quad\\mathrm{JCNF}(())(x)=1,\\quad\n\\mathrm{JDNF}(\\langle(\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\rangle)(x)=1,\\quad\n\\mathrm{JCNF}(\\langle(\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\rangle)(x)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>抽象接口对应原书每个word的正文字表A与负文字表B；实际文本以“-”分隔两表，以“+”或“&amp;”分隔word。本条不宣称复刻软件完整解析器或自动吸收行为。空列表与含一个空word的列表严格区分。交叉重复文字无需先排除：DNF项自动为0，CNF子句自动为1。附录C为历史软件说明，未联网验证旧下载地址和当代平台兼容性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\{a,\\ldots,z,1,\\ldots,6\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W=((A_k,B_k))_{k=1}^m","display":false},{"tex":"A_k,B_k\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"A_k\\cap B_k\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"x:V\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee,\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JDNF},\\mathrm{JCNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JDNF}(W)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{k=1}^m\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{v\\in A_k}x(v)\\land\\bigwedge_{v\\in B_k}(1-x(v))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JCNF}(W)(x)\\coloneqq\\bigwedge_{k=1}^m\n\\left(\\bigvee_{v\\in A_k}x(v)\\lor\\bigvee_{v\\in B_k}(1-x(v))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JDNF}(())(x)=0,\\quad\\